<title>USA: Food Court names Perkins chief executive.</title>
<headline>Food Court names Perkins chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Court Entertainment Network Inc said chief operating officer James Perkins has been named president and chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He replaces Stephen Bowen, who has resigned and is returning to the advertising industry.</p>
<p>Perkins has served as chief operating officer since February.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
